# C/C++ build artifacts (test binaries are compiled in-tree)
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.lo
*.la

# Python build cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Editor / IDE
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# Build output dirs
build/
.deps/
.libs/

# Test output (only under tests/ subdirs by brief; evidence .log files at CP / phase dirs are tracked)
tests/*.log

# Tarball backups (project convention: evidence tarballs live outside the tree per CIPHER discipline)
*.tar.gz
*.tar.bz2
*.tar.xz

# Markdown backup snapshots
*.md.bak
*.md.v1.0.bak
*.md.v1.1.bak
*.md.v1.2.bak

# Notes:
# - Markdown evidence (audit waves, CP closeouts, design memos) is the load-bearing content.
# - JSON result files and per-CP .log files outside tests/ are evidence and tracked.
# - Compiled test binaries (e.g., cp_5_4/step1_3/cp54_isolation_test) are tracked as
#   evidence artifacts despite being binary; they reproduce the byte-identical run
#   referenced in WEEK_1_PRE_FLIGHT.md §3.1.
